571
00:19:17,100 --> 00:19:18,110
I've never tried.

572
00:19:18,550 --> 00:19:19,630
A sticky note?

573
00:19:20,870 --> 00:19:21,750
You lose.

574
00:19:21,750 --> 00:19:23,030
That was your last guess.

575
00:19:23,540 --> 00:19:24,100
What?

576
00:19:24,420 --> 00:19:25,220
A blueberry.

577
00:19:29,350 --> 00:19:31,230
Does that mean we passed?

578
00:19:31,430 --> 00:19:32,230
Yeah, we passed.

579
00:19:32,230 --> 00:19:33,780
(Mini plates unlocked)

580
00:19:34,390 --> 00:19:35,660
Let's press out the shapes.

581
00:19:35,660 --> 00:19:36,120
Okay.

582
00:19:38,700 --> 00:19:39,940
(Presses hard)

583
00:19:41,670 --> 00:19:42,660
