584
00:19:42,660 --> 00:19:43,470
(Checks on her)
Yeah.

585
00:19:48,540 --> 00:19:49,540
(Happy)

586
00:19:49,540 --> 00:19:50,220
It came out.

587
00:19:50,220 --> 00:19:51,100
That fast?

588
00:19:51,100 --> 00:19:52,150
Take it out.

589
00:19:52,150 --> 00:19:53,420
(First one successfully shaped)

590
00:19:53,860 --> 00:19:55,060
(Right behind her)
Mine came out as well.

591
00:19:55,070 --> 00:19:56,110
Let's press out all the shapes first.

592
00:19:58,020 --> 00:20:00,340
(Keeps pressing)

593
00:20:02,940 --> 00:20:06,140
(Busy pressing)

594
00:20:06,140 --> 00:20:06,510
Okay.

595
00:20:09,150 --> 00:20:10,740
Then we carve them, right?

596
00:20:10,740 --> 00:20:11,540
Right.

597
00:20:11,540 --> 00:20:12,260
What should we carve?

598
00:20:12,260 --> 00:20:12,700
You mean

599
00:20:12,700 --> 00:20:13,230
