600
00:20:13,230 --> 00:20:13,830
How about our initials

601
00:20:13,830 --> 00:20:14,510
on them?

602
00:20:15,350 --> 00:20:16,270
(Laughs)
Our initials.

603
00:20:16,270 --> 00:20:18,710
And yours can have a little star.

604
00:20:18,740 --> 00:20:20,660
(Nods)

605
00:20:28,630 --> 00:20:29,860
Did you carve your name?

606
00:20:30,340 --> 00:20:31,140
Sure.

607
00:20:31,310 --> 00:20:32,140
Here.

608
00:20:32,350 --> 00:20:34,500
You can carve your name

609
