610
00:20:36,070 --> 00:20:36,860
(Swaps magnets to carve their names)

611
00:20:46,950 --> 00:20:48,660
So yours is the name version.

612
00:20:48,660 --> 00:20:49,220
XX.

613
00:20:50,550 --> 00:20:51,350
Double "Xing".

614
00:20:53,580 --> 00:20:56,860
