617
00:21:03,750 --> 00:21:05,190
Looks like you're about to make cookies.

618
00:21:05,900 --> 00:21:07,020
Make cookies?

619
00:21:07,020 --> 00:21:08,020
Are you craving some?

620
00:21:08,540 --> 00:21:09,620
Yeah.

621
00:21:09,620 --> 00:21:10,700
We've cooked together before,

622
00:21:10,700 --> 00:21:11,950
