632
00:21:32,830 --> 00:21:34,030
This is a tree.

633
00:21:34,150 --> 00:21:35,230
And there's a star inside.

634
00:21:35,310 --> 00:21:35,950
Right.

635
00:21:36,420 --> 00:21:36,710
Right.

636
00:21:36,710 --> 00:21:37,510
(The tree represents Sun Bohan)
The tree is you.

637
00:21:37,510 --> 00:21:38,630
Yeah. It's wrapped around you.

638
00:21:38,630 --> 00:21:39,750
It's wrapped around you.

639
00:21:39,750 --> 00:21:40,430
Okay.

640
00:21:40,430 --> 00:21:41,860
(Wrapped around you. Okay)

641
00:21:43,270 --> 00:21:44,430
I put you right in the middle.

642
00:21:45,230 --> 00:21:46,190
I think it's pretty meaningful.

643
00:21:48,540 --> 00:21:49,260
Look.

644
00:21:49,260 --> 00:21:50,510
This is us rowing?

645
00:21:50,620 --> 00:21:51,060
(Smiles)
Yeah.

646
00:21:51,070 --> 00:21:52,350
And there's a star in the river.

647
00:21:54,260 --> 00:21:55,340
(The star's right here)

648
00:21:55,340 --> 00:21:57,270
You gave me a little inspiration.

649
00:21:57,270 --> 00:21:59,030
