Each one has a unique touch.

653
00:22:08,030 --> 00:22:09,630
Do you know what this means?

654
00:22:10,230 --> 00:22:11,630
These are scissors.

655
00:22:12,270 --> 00:22:14,350
These two lines don't overlap.

656
00:22:14,670 --> 00:22:16,180
(The lines don't overlap)
But in the middle, they're...

657
00:22:16,180 --> 00:22:16,940
It's a bow.

658
00:22:17,140 --> 00:22:17,860
It's tied together.

659
00:22:17,860 --> 00:22:18,380
A bow.

660
00:22:18,380 --> 00:22:19,180
(The bow represents us)
It's us.

661
00:22:19,580 --> 00:22:20,380
It's us.

662
00:22:20,390 --> 00:22:22,060
(It's us)

663
00:22:22,190 --> 00:22:23,670
Look, I copied

664
00:22:23,670 --> 00:22:24,710
(Copies the little bow)
your little bow.

665
00:22:24,710 --> 00:22:26,230
Nice. We can have everyone

666
00:22:26,230 --> 00:22:27,430
guess which one I drew myself,

667
00:22:27,430 --> 00:22:28,270
and which one you drew.

668
00:22:28,710 --> 00:22:30,110
We're all done.

669
00:22:30,350 --> 00:22:31,910
(Magnets complete)
I think they turned out pretty well.

670
00:22:31,910 --> 00:22:32,790
I'm pretty happy with them.

671
00:22:32,950 --> 00:22:34,590
Next, we'll paint the plates.

672
00:22:34,590 --> 00:22:36,060
Okay. Let's paint these little plates.

673
00:22:36,060 --> 00:22:37,390
Let's just do whatever we want, okay?

674
00:22:37,990 --> 00:22:39,580
I'll make mine yellow.

675
00:22:40,020 --> 00:22:41,940
I'll make mine green.

676
00:22:42,300 --> 00:22:42,860
Okay.

677
00:22:42,860 --> 00:22:43,310
Sounds good.

678
00:22:47,550 --> 00:22:49,380
We're making these plates
to remind everyone

679
00:22:49,380 --> 00:22:50,550
