680
00:22:50,550 --> 00:22:52,430
Right. There's a meaning
behind them too.

681
00:22:52,430 --> 00:22:53,110
Right.

682
00:22:53,110 --> 00:22:54,830
You can use them for rice,

683
00:22:55,310 --> 00:22:56,790
