684
00:22:57,500 --> 00:22:58,140
Blueberries.

685
00:22:58,140 --> 00:22:58,940
Right.

686
00:22:59,700 --> 00:23:02,820
Then I'll paint a blue plate later.

687
00:23:02,820 --> 00:23:03,620
Okay.

688
00:23:08,020 --> 00:23:09,140
(Leans in)

689
00:23:11,020 --> 00:23:11,750
You know what?

690
00:23:11,750 --> 00:23:13,020
Yours actually looks really good.

691
00:23:13,140 --> 00:23:14,180
(Smiles)

692
00:23:16,020 --> 00:23:17,100
(Star)

693
00:23:19,500 --> 00:23:20,380
(BH, Bohan)

694
00:23:27,230 --> 00:23:28,700
I'll make this plate blue.

695
00:23:28,700 --> 00:23:29,500
Sure.

696
00:23:31,630 --> 00:23:32,270
You know what?

697
00:23:32,270 --> 00:23:33,710
It looks really nice in pink.

698
00:23:34,470 --> 00:23:35,580
It looks like a rose.

699
00:23:35,580 --> 00:23:36,780
Yeah. Once it's fired,

700
00:23:36,780 --> 00:23:38,190
